{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1434232-tc-adventure-kickstarter","id":1434232,"title":"TC Adventure! Kickstarter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Adventure!"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-02-02T00:51:59-08:00","id":1434232,"title":"TC Adventure! Kickstarter","content":"Onyx Path announced Kickstarter for <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure!</b> on April 2021! Plus they will run podcast 'series' each Wednesday to this date. I'm excited!<br /> <br /> <i>\u2018While that Kickstarter is running, we continue to prep for the next ones. One of those, but not the next, is the Kickstarter for the long-awaited pulp-genre addition to the <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure! </b>If you remember, we ran a multi-part web-comic in the month leading up to <b>TC: Aberrant</b>, and we wanted to have another fun lead-in for <b>TC: Adventure!</b>. We considered a pulp magazine story, with b&amp;w illustrations and all that, but that was sort of the look for Adventure!\u2018s first edition. It\u2019s not a bad idea, but I was looking for another way to present a <b>TC: Adventure</b> lead-in story.<br /> <br /> It has always seemed to me that podcasts like <b>Welcome To Nightvale</b> are very much following a grand tradition of the great old radio series that were such an important part of people\u2019s lives before the onset of television. Which led to asking: what better way to give the feel of 1930\u2019s media than to do our own radio drama?! So starting on Wednesday, we will release a weekly serial episode \u2013 short, like many of them were \u2013 for six weeks as we lead up to the <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure!</b> Kickstarter.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> Monday Meeting Notes - <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/i-only-need-two-things-dragons-and-cthulhu-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/i-only-need-t...meeting-notes/</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/\u200bhttp://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Tales-of-the-Aeon-Society-cover.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Tales-of-the-Aeon-Society-cover.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-02-2021, 05:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-02T07:31:38-08:00","id":1434256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1434232-tc-adventure-kickstarter#post1434232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Onyx Path announced Kickstarter for <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure!</b> on April 2021!</div> </div> </div> </div>Please note that this statement:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So starting on Wednesday, we will release a weekly serial episode \u2013 short, like many of them were \u2013 for six weeks as we lead up to the <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure!</b> Kickstarter.\u2019[/I] </div> </div> </div>This does not necessarily mean that the Adventure! Kickstarter will follow immediately after the audio adventure. It might! But this is not a guarantee.<br /> <br /> It's two separate things: the audio adventure will run for six weeks, and then near the end of that -- maybe immediately, maybe several weeks later -- we'll do the Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Until you see Rich give a date, statements like &quot;April 2021&quot; are just estimates and not official.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-03T10:25:38-08:00","id":1434396,"title":"","content":"First part of T<b><i>ales of the Aeon Society!</i></b> is published on Podbean on Onyx Pathcast channel - and on OPP website!<br /> <br /> \u200b<a href=\"https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/tales-of-the-aeon-society-episode-1-deadly-eclipse/\" target=\"_blank\">https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/t...eadly-eclipse/</a><br /> <br /> And<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/tales-of-the-aeon-society-episode-1-deadly-eclipse/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img 