,"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T15:31:50-07:00","id":1440279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1434232-tc-adventure-kickstarter?p=1440229#post1440229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://rpgbooks.fandom.com/wiki/Trinity_Storytellers_Handbook/Prologue_Fiction\" target=\"_blank\">https://rpgbooks.fandom.com/wiki/Tri...ologue_Fiction</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Chapter 6 is the best source of random ideas for games! The other chapters are interesting, but are far less done than chapter 6. I remember reading this a long time ago and thinking \u201cwhy did they cancel the line?\u201d<br /> <br /> Are you still working in this project, Ian? Is there anyone working in this project?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T15:50:01-07:00","id":1440286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1434232-tc-adventure-kickstarter?p=1440279#post1440279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Chapter 6 is the best source of random ideas for games! The other chapters are interesting, but are far less done than chapter 6. I remember reading this a long time ago and thinking \u201cwhy did they cancel the line?\u201d<br /> <br /> Are you still working in this project, Ian? Is there anyone working in this project?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it hasn't been touched in over 15 years at this point. But many of the ideas that were going into that one got folded into the development of the current edition of \u00c6on.<br /> <br /> That early incomplete draft still has some good stuff that will otherwise never see the light of day, so I haven't done much about shutting down an otherwise-unused Wiki.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T18:41:48-07:00","id":1440318,"title":"","content":"I especially like the Terran Empire version. Such a cool idea. So much potential there. <br /> <br /> That all said, since this is about the Adventure! kickstarter my reaction is one of unbridled glee. Yes!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! So glad to see this come out soon. There is so much potential in what Adventure! brings, not just in terms of setting (though the time period of the game is a pretty fun one to play in) but the expansion of the rules so that its not just Talents at that level but hopefully Mesmerists and Stalwarts too. I especially like this element as there are many campaign settings where the Adventure! type Inspired make 'better' player characters than the vastly more showy powers of Psions/Psiads and Novas. <br /> <br /> So yeah, once the link goes up my money will be spent to get it and not just it but it in a physical form too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-18T03:03:53-07:00","id":1440438,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-j8qzm-fb15b6\" target=\"_blank\">Complete <i>Tales of the Aeon Society</i>, combined!</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-22T09:04:30-07:00","id":1440948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1434232-tc-adventure-kickstarter?p=1440318#post1440318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is so much potential in what Adventure! brings, not just in terms of setting (though the time period of the game is a pretty fun one to play in) but the expansion of the rules so that its not just Talents at that level but hopefully Mesmerists and Stalwarts too. I especially like this element as there are many campaign settings where the Adventure! type Inspired make 'better' player characters than the vastly more showy powers of Psions/Psiads and Novas.<br /> <br /> So yeah, once the link goes up my money will be spent to get it and not just it but it in a physical form too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I agree wholeheartedly! For my own games, I prefer the lower-tier supers of Adventure! I am already plotting campaign settings, adventures and gadgets for this upcoming game. I am eager to back this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-24T06:10:18-07:00","id":1441232,"title":"","content":"<b><img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TC-Adventure-Splash-Image.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> TC: Adventure! Kickstarter</b> starts tomorrow - and Pathcast about it is on next day! '<b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure! </b>and its KS starting on Thursday at 2pm EDT. <b>TC: Adventure! </b>is the third of the Trinity (Aeon) games that we have redone for this new edition inside the Continuum and it\u2019s always been one of my favorites! More on why and just what\u2019s so damn enjoyable about the Pulp genre will come up here in the weeks to come, but for now let\u2019s start with the idea that anything could happen, the idea that you would find both wonders and perils if you chose to find them. <b>Adventure!</b> is right around the corner!<br /> Finally, in reference to the challenges of this era as noted above, here\u2019s a quote from the team:<br /> \u201c<b>TC: Adventure! </b>is an updated, more inclusive take on the pulp genre\u201d. We\u2019ll have more on just what that means once the KS goes live and excerpts start being released, and also on this Friday\u2019s Onyx Pathcast when the crew take one of their patented Deep Dives into the game. See you Thursday!'<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/what-evil-lurks-in-the-heart-of-empire-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/what-evil-lurks-in-the-heart-of-empire-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> What Evil Lurks in the Heart of Empire? [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/what-evil-lurks-in-the-heart-of-empire-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/what-evil-lurks-in-the-heart-of-empire-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"typ